IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0007.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0007C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 CREDIT-DECN        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM CREDIT-CUTOFF
    DISPLAY "CREDIT-DECN=" CREDIT-DECN
    STOP RUN.
CREDIT-CUTOFF.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF TX-CREDIT-SCORE >= 576
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN TX-CREDIT-SCORE >= 720
           AND TX-DTI-RATIO LESS THAN 0.35
            MOVE 'A' TO CREDIT-DECN
        WHEN TX-CREDIT-SCORE NOT LESS THAN 680
            MOVE 'R' TO CREDIT-DECN
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO CREDIT-DECN
    END-EVALUATE.
